cff-version: 1.2.0
title: llm-segmentation-eval
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Peshkov
    given-names: Klim
repository-code: "https://github.com/klimpe/llm-segmentation-eval"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation of LLM segmentation of transcripts against human
  annotation, read against inter-annotator agreement. Covers
  written text (DISRPT), spoken English (Santa Barbara Corpus;
  intonation units, i.e. prosodic rather than discourse
  segmentation) and, in progress, spoken French (CID).
keywords:
  - discourse segmentation
  - prosodic segmentation
  - evaluation
  - inter-annotator agreement
  - spoken language
  - prosody
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-11"
